{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>To gather stubble for straw.</b> To gather a gathering, to glean a gleaning, for the need of straw — clay." "<b>Stubble.</b> A term of gathering — because a thing that is scattered and needs to be gathered (לְקוֹשְׁשׁוֹ) is called קַשׁ in other places."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:37.693350352Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}